    "Right panel C: small right triangle with vertices at origin, (1,0) and (cos x, sin x) scaled to same base, pale pink fill, red outline, base labeled '1', angle 'x', thin red dashed vertical drop from apex, blue dashed arc outside the triangle, curly brace on the right labeled 'sin x'",
    "Caption row: 'Area of triangle  ≥  Area of sector  ≥  Area of triangle'",
    "Formula row: 'tan x / 2  ≥  x / 2  ≥  sin x / 2'",
    "Live numeric readout of tan x / 2, x / 2, sin x / 2 and of sin x / x (added for the slider)",
    "Highlight ring / glow used when a panel label is clicked"
